= 3.4729 at 1550 nm); SiO2 is constant n = 1.4425. The domain is the device plus 1 µm margins: 34 × 7 × 2.22 µm³ (the paper uses 34 × 7.5 × 4 µm³). TE0 enters o1 (lower left) at 1550 nm with a λ/12 source bandwidth (the paper uses 20 nm). The energy shutoff is 1e-4 (1e-3 for nres ≤ 10; the paper uses 1e-5). We report the cross-port (o3) transmission, the excess loss, the solve time, and the peak memory against resolution.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"NexwfhgX4L"}],"key":"kvW70W0TPv"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Paper values (Tidy3D 2.7.7 on cloud GPUs, Lumerical 2025 R1 on a 24-core CPU; transmission digitized from Fig. 12a):","position":{"start":{"line":5,"column":1},"end":{"line":5,"column":1}},"key":"cV4SJkpHqf"}],"key":"wiTZjN0JMS"},{"type":"table","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":13,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableRow","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"nres","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"npDTnVA5XH"}],"key":"dbz3wVqPFx"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Tidy3D cross T","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"KC2NXqCaSB"}],"key":"YEsp8ZtF14"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Lumerical cross T","position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1}},"key":"gV3aaxoU4g"}],"key":"EKuiKYNvOu"},{"type":"tableCell","header":true,"position":{"start":{"line":7,"column":1},"end":{"line":7,"column":1